  "instrument": "guitar",
  "teaches": "technique",
  "style": "Metal",
  "instructions": "On the high E: tap with the picking hand's middle finger, pull off to the fifth fret, hammer on the eighth, in sixteenth triplets; then move the tap up for each chord. Rest the picking hand's palm on the low strings and keep the fretting hand's first finger flat across them, so only the high E sounds.",
